      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "value": "As useful as blocking is, its still a major problem for newcomers who dont know all the functions and buttons. They came to have fun and are being harrased instead. At this point they should be reported. Although i never actually got around to the official rules and methods for reporting, you can look it up on the discord. So if you want to report them go ahead read up on how to do it. This shouldnt be tolerated.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
